zj/thumb/3/3a/ectg89iccmve5d6lxu9rnfuxy3rahec.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%97%8B%E9%A3%8E%E6%88%98%E6%96%A7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3a/ectg89iccmve5d6lxu9rnfuxy3rahec.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%97%8B%E9%A3%8E%E6%88%98%E6%96%A7.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3a/ectg89iccmve5d6lxu9rnfuxy3rahec.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />旋风战斧\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>伤害，每击败<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个敌人，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bb/qlqfhw2nk8ggpo6od4xm6wbe6428tai.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width